message: "If you use this software, please cite it as described here."
title: "Pukara"
abstract: >-
  A privacy-first, self-hosted gateway for local large language models: a
  Dockerized Ollama server behind an AES-256-GCM encryption proxy and a desktop
  client that anonymizes sensitive entities on-device (BERT + regex) before
  sending data to the server.
authors: ["Marrero Garcia, Ramsés", "Peñafiel, Petter Axel"]
keywords:
  - ollama
  - encryption
  - anonymization
  - privacy
  - llm
  - spanish
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-18
